♪♪ Guess we better
Leave her there ♪♪

1330
01:04:31,243 --> 01:04:33,202
♪♪ Let's go, boys
Potato's in the paddy wagon ♪♪

1331
01:04:33,411 --> 01:04:37,998
♪♪ Mama says it's more than fair
Mama says it's more than fair ♪♪

