1376
01:07:55,196 --> 01:07:57,156
♪♪ There's popcorn in the popper
And a porker in the pot ♪♪

1377
01:07:57,365 --> 01:07:59,158
♪♪ There's pie in the pantry
And the coffee's always hot ♪♪

1378
01:07:59,367 --> 01:08:01,160
