Ready, three, wide.
Three.

1401
01:09:14,025 --> 01:09:17,027
Oh, my God. Mitch is gone.
He's just, he's gone.

1402
01:09:17,237 --> 01:09:19,780
Mitch is gone. Oh, my God.

1403
01:09:19,989 --> 01:09:22,783
Without Mitch, we got gornisht.
We have nothing.

1404
01:09:22,992 --> 01:09:25,661
Well, we're gonna
go find him.

1405
01:09:28,915 --> 01:09:31,708
Yeah, we're gonna need some
chickens. We got any chickens?

1406
01:09:31,876 --> 01:09:33,836
How about this aisle?
Beyond this aisle.

1407
01:09:34,045 --> 01:09:36,130
Just beyond the man
with the big shirt.

1408
